        "<h4>Monte Carlo Integration Method with Variable Functions</h4>\n",
        "Code originally created by Saikat Sahana and posted on Geeks for Geeks website\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "(https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/python/monte-carlo-integration-in-python/)\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "Specific question: How does the number of samples required to achieve a given tolerance change based on the function?"
      ]
